.. math::
    \text{out}_{i} =
    \begin{cases}
      1, & \text{if}\ \text{input}_{i}=0 \\
      \sin(\pi \text{input}_{i}) / (\pi \text{input}_{i}), & \text{otherwise}
    \end{cases}


Args:
